      "extract": "The p-adic polylogarithm is an analogue of its complex cousin. It was deﬁned by Coleman [7] using the technique now referred to as Coleman integration. On the open unit disc in Cp, the so called ﬁeld of p-adic complex numbers, it is again deﬁned by the power series (1.1). To extend it to a function deﬁned on Cp \\ {1} Coleman uses a technique he called “analytic continuation along Frobenius”, which is rather",
